  "description": "Reactive notification system for .NET with multi-transport support. Provides a composable notification infrastructure with InMemory (System.Reactive) and Redis transports. Features include: fluent builder API, composite pattern for multiple transports, automatic deduplication across transports, tag-based filtering, type-safe notification routing, health checks, and seamless integration with .NET dependency injection. Supports both fire-and-forget and reactive observable patterns.",
